      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe focused implementation matches the issue requirements and is covered across all supported profiling-selection modes.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nLimits accelerator synchronization to communication operations selected for profiling, reducing unnecessary logging overhead.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Guard accelerator synchronization with `should_profile`.\n- Test synchronization behavior across profiling modes.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `deepspeed/​comm/​comm.py` | Skips synchronization for unprofiled operations. |\r\n| `tests/​unit/​comm/​test_comms_logger.py` | Verifies synchronization call counts. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/new/master?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
